        "metaparameter": "n_runspecchainedto"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "chain"
        ],
        "note": "0 rows. Nothing in this run is a CHAINED pollutant, unlike `process-tirewear` where PM10 tire wear is computed by scaling PM2.5. An empty relation is a selection like any other and is declared rather than omitted, so the document says the run has no chain instead of leaving it to be inferred from a missing source.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
